# frontend-components

This is a lightweight Codex adapter for the workspace-local WelineFramework skill.

## Required Workflow

1. Read `dev/ai/skills/frontend-components/SKILL.md` completely before acting on matching tasks.
2. If that skill points to required references, read only the relevant referenced files.
3. Keep `dev/ai/skills` as the single source of truth; do not duplicate detailed rules here.
4. Also respect `dev/ai/global-constraints.md` for cross-skill hard constraints (including storefront section `weline-code`; see `app/code/Weline/Theme/doc/frontend-section-weline-code.md`).
5. Canonical skill path is `dev/ai/skills/前端主题工程师-组件与页面构建/SKILL.md` (this alias name may resolve via `dev/ai/skills/frontend-components/SKILL.md`).
